---
// Modules.astro — Lo que encontrarás en la guía
---

<section class="modules">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <span class="badge-coral">CONTENIDO EXCLUSIVO</span>
      <h2 class="title">¿Qué vas a descubrir dentro de esta guía?</h2>
      <p class="subtitle">Una hoja de ruta clara para dejar de perder ventas y empezar a escalar con un sistema real.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid">
      <!-- Módulo 1 -->
      <div class="module-card">
        <div class="icon-box">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Auditoría de Perfil</h3>
        <p>Cómo profesionalizar tu WhatsApp Business en 15 minutos para generar confianza instantánea.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Módulo 2 -->
      <div class="module-card featured">
        <div class="icon-box">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="12 2 2 7 12 12 22 7 12 2"></polygon><polyline points="2 17 12 22 22 17"></polyline><polyline points="2 12 12 17 22 12"></polyline></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Embudo de Etiquetas</h3>
        <p>El sistema de 4 pasos para clasificar clientes por intención de compra y cerrar más rápido.</p>
        <span class="feature-tag">EL MÁS VALORADO</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Módulo 3 -->
      <div class="module-card">
        <div class="icon-box">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"></polyline></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Plan de Seguimiento</h3>
        <p>La rutina diaria de 20 minutos diseñada para recuperar ventas que dabas por perdidas.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .modules {
    padding: 8rem 1.5rem;
    background: var(--violet-deep);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* Sutil resplandor de fondo */
  .modules::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -10%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 60%;
    height: 40%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(123, 63, 228, 0.15) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto 4rem auto;
  }

  .badge-coral {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--coral);
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 5px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--coral);
  }

  .title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-light);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--violet-bright);
    line-height: 1.6;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .module-card {
    background: rgba(28, 6, 71, 0.4);
    border: 1px solid rgba(169, 110, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 2.5rem;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .module-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-10px);
    border-color: rgba(169, 110, 255, 0.3);
    background: rgba(28, 6, 71, 0.6);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
  }

  .module-card.featured {
    border-color: var(--violet-mid);
    background: rgba(123, 63, 228, 0.1);
    box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(123, 63, 228, 0.1);
  }

  .icon-box {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    background: var(--violet-dark);
    border-radius: 16px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--yellow-pastel);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(169, 110, 255, 0.1);
  }

  .featured .icon-box {
    background: var(--violet-mid);
    color: var(--yellow-pastel);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(123, 63, 228, 0.2);
  }

  .module-card h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-light);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .module-card p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--violet-bright);
    line-height: 1.6;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .feature-tag {
    position: absolute;
    top: -12px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: var(--yellow-pastel);
    color: var(--violet-deep);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
    }

    .modules {
      padding: 6rem 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
